This guide will take you from zero to a running Sidey site, without prior Astro knowledge required.

## Prerequisites

Before you begin, make sure you have the following installed:

- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org) `v22.12.0` or higher
- Text editor
- Terminal
- [GitHub](https://github.com/login) Account (Optional)

## Installation

Sidey is a GitHub template. Head over to the [astro-sidey](https://github.com/odhyp/astro-sidey) repository and click **Use this template** to create a new repository from it.

Then clone your new repository and install dependencies:

```bash
git clone [https://github.com/your-username/your-repo.git](https://github.com/your-username/your-repo.git)
cd your-repo
npm install
